        "block_ids": [
          "screenplay-04-lantern-home-s001-b018"
        ]
      },
      "original_speaker": "周掌柜"
    },
    {
      "text": "明天许家嫁女儿，要唱《送青篷》。你娘说你能唱，我替你应下了。傍晚先来唱一遍，可不能也省两段。",
      "source": {
        "object_id": "screenplay-04-lantern-home-e01",
        "revision_id": "8148732c492764da35ae228d6ba7613ae8108fb121aa30802088165721e3013e",
        "scene_id": "s001",
        "block_ids": [
          "screenplay-04-lantern-home-s001-b020"
        ]
      },
      "original_speaker": "周掌柜"
    },
    {
      "text": "这把先付你。唱成了，明天的报酬够你家吃几天。",
      "source": {
        "object_id": "screenplay-04-lantern-home-e01",
        "revision_id": "8148732c492764da35ae228d6ba7613ae8108fb121aa30802088165721e3013e",
        "scene_id": "s001",
        "block_ids": [
          "screenplay-04-lantern-home-s001-b024"
        ]
      },
      "original_speaker": "周掌柜"
    },
    {
      "text": "从第二段来。",
      "source": {
        "object_id": "screenplay-04-lantern-home-e02",
        "revision_id": "3d68c31be1c91938d71734a60d7486dd9c17eed67ae88d51a23772a7ba61245d",
